---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Disclosure"
	description="Yeh Bro disclosure — when links may earn a commission, what we cover, and health information limits."
	canonicalPath="/disclosure"
>
	<article class="prose-wrap">
		<p class="eyebrow">Policy</p>
		<h1>Disclosure</h1>
		<p class="muted"><strong>Last updated:</strong> 2026-10-31</p>
		<p class="lede">
			Yeh Bro publishes gym and bodybuilding education. Some product links may earn a commission if
			you buy — plain English below.
		</p>

		<h2>Product links</h2>
		<p>
			Some links use <code>/go/[slug]</code> redirects. If you buy through them, Yeh Bro may earn a
			<strong>commission at no extra cost to you</strong>. Picks are editorial — creatine, protein,
			pre/intra, basics — judged on labels, dosing clarity, and value, not whoever pays most.
			Sponsored or gifted posts get labelled separately.
		</p>

		<h2>Amazon Associates</h2>
		<p>
			Yeh Bro is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program (Amazon AU).
			<strong>As an Amazon Associate we earn from qualifying purchases</strong> when you buy through
			our Amazon <code>/go/*-amz</code> links. Amazon search/browse links may be swapped for specific
			product ASINs later; disclosure still applies.
		</p>

		<h2>What we don’t link</h2>
		<p>
			We don’t sell or source AAS, restricted SARMs, unapproved peptides, underground gear, or
			“cycle / blast / PCT” product funnels. Culture and PED pages are education — risks, bloodwork,
			legal context — not a dosing protocol and not a storefront. See
			<a href="/blog/ped-harm-reduction-australia">PED harm reduction</a>.
		</p>

		<h2>Health information</h2>
		<p>
			Nothing here is medical advice, diagnosis, or legal advice. Talk to a qualified clinician about
			your situation before changing diet, training, supplements, or anything pharmacological. Crisis
			support (AU): <a href="https://www.lifeline.org.au/">Lifeline</a> 13 11 14.
		</p>

		<h2>Questions</h2>
		<p>
			<a href="mailto:hello@yehbro.com">hello@yehbro.com</a> ·
			<a href="/contact">Contact</a> ·
			<a href="/start-here">Start here</a>
		</p>
	</article>
</BaseLayout>
